 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 3.08,
   "end": 6.405,
   "text": "Optimization usually lives in flat space.",
   "translation": "优化通常发生在平坦的空间里。"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.4351,
   "end": 19.3351,
   "text": "But the world is curved.",
   "translation": "但世界是弯曲的。"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.8106,
   "end": 32.0856,
   "text": "Robot arms turn through space, and drones must close their loops.",
   "translation": "机械臂在空间中转动，无人机要闭合回环。"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.8106,
   "end": 43.9106,
   "text": "Neural networks, hierarchies, the brain, the data we collect.",
   "translation": "神经网络、层级结构、大脑、我们采集的数据。"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.8106,
   "end": 59.3106,
   "text": "They all live on manifolds: spaces that curve as a whole, yet look flat up close.",
   "translation": "它们都生活在流形上：整体弯曲、近看却平坦的空间。"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.8106,
   "end": 68.4606,
   "text": "To optimize there, every familiar idea must be rebuilt: direction, distance, gradient, step.",
   "translation": "要在那里做优化，每个熟悉的概念都必须重建：方向、距离、梯度、步长。"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.5579,
   "end": 103.7829,
   "text": "Riemannian Optimization, from the Ground Up.",
   "translation": "从零开始的黎曼优化。"
  }
 ]
}